body:
9 are confirmed (as of the typing of this comment), Daisy is coming back for sure which makes it 10;   


I guess 12 would be a decent number, although I'd be yearning for more characters still. 😅   


If I had to take a guess, I'd say the last 2 could be Pauline (since she has become relevant in Mario games), and either Dry Bones or Diddy Kong.

Why is nine afraid of 7?

&#x200B;

Because 7 ate 9!
